#: ../../source/templates_figma.md:72
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_figma.md:73
msgid ""
"**Variable font precision**: figmaSans uses weights that most systems "
"never touch — 320, 330, 340, 450, 480, 540. This creates hierarchy "
"through subtle weight differences rather than dramatic jumps. The "
"difference between 330 and 340 is nearly imperceptible but structurally "
"significant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_figma.md:74
msgid ""
"**Light as the base**: Most body text uses 320–340 (lighter than typical "
"400 \"regular\"), creating an ethereal, airy reading experience that "
"matches the design-tool aesthetic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_figma.md:75
msgid ""
"**Kern everywhere**: Every text element enables OpenType `\"kern\"` "
"feature — kerning is not optional, it's structural."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_figma.md:76
msgid ""
"**Negative tracking by default**: Even body text uses -0.1px to -0.26px "
"letter-spacing, creating universally tight text. Display text compresses "
"further to -0.96px and -1.72px."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_figma.md:77
msgid ""
"**Mono for structure**: figmaMono in uppercase with positive letter-"
"spacing (0.54px–0.6px) creates technical signpost labels."
msgstr ""

